{"id":"a2160ec9261f8f3b","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-zfc-total-relation.md","title":"ZFC Total Relation","display":"df-zfc-total-relation — ZFC Total Relation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-total-relation","aliases":["58-df-zfc-total-relation"],"display":"df-zfc-total-relation — ZFC Total Relation","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-zfc-rel-domain]]","[[58-df-zfc-set12-kuratowski-pair-code]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-total-relation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-total-relation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-total-relation — ZFC Total Relation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"97c28eede56ea5e4\" href=\"?note=97c28eede56ea5e4\" title=\"58-df-zfc-rel-domain\">58-df-zfc-rel-domain</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c7cf057d5daacec1\" href=\"?note=c7cf057d5daacec1\" title=\"58-df-zfc-set12-kuratowski-pair-code\">58-df-zfc-set12-kuratowski-pair-code</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R,A\\in V\">\\(R,A\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRelDomain}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRelDomain}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> is from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"97c28eede56ea5e4\" href=\"?note=97c28eede56ea5e4\" title=\"58-df-zfc-rel-domain\">58-df-zfc-rel-domain</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TotalRelation}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{TotalRelation}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}total\\text{-}relation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{TotalRelation}_S(R,A)\n\\leftrightarrow\nR\\subseteq A\\times A\\land\\mathrm{ZfcRelDomain}_S(A,R).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}total\\text{-}relation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{TotalRelation}_S(R,A)\n\\leftrightarrow\nR\\subseteq A\\times A\\land\\mathrm{ZfcRelDomain}_S(A,R).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Here “total” means left-total on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>: every input in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> has an <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span>-successor in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>. It is distinct from the connex/linear-order use of “total relation”.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-rel-domain","status":"resolved","id":"97c28eede56ea5e4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-rel-domain]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-set12-kuratowski-pair-code","status":"resolved","id":"c7cf057d5daacec1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-set12-kuratowski-pair-code]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-rel-domain","status":"resolved","id":"97c28eede56ea5e4","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcRelDomain}_S\\subseteq V^2$ is from [[58-df-zfc-rel-domain]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"R,A\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRelDomain}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TotalRelation}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}total\\text{-}relation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{TotalRelation}_S(R,A)\n\\leftrightarrow\nR\\subseteq A\\times A\\land\\mathrm{ZfcRelDomain}_S(A,R).","display":true},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false}],"bytes":858,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3747","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-total-relation.md|58-df-zfc-total-relation]]（batch14）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","97c28eede56ea5e4","c7cf057d5daacec1"]}